  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2013.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este domingo se ha iniciado la pre-temporada para la II Liga de Improvisaci&oacute;n Teatral de Onda, en el local de Arteatre de la calle Ingeniero Echegaray, donde cada semana se concentrar&aacute;n para entrenar las personas interesadas en participar.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2011.jpg\" alt=\"img_2011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2012.jpg\" alt=\"img_2012\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2013.jpg\" alt=\"img_2013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2014.jpg\" alt=\"img_2014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2015.jpg\" alt=\"img_2015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2016.jpg\" alt=\"img_2016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2017.jpg\" alt=\"img_2017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2018.jpg\" alt=\"img_2018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entrenamentlligaimprovisacioteatral/img_2019.jpg\